data: {"id": "fb7316a3e3f64f75-thinking-parallel_evidence-759", "run_id": "fb7316a3e3f64f75", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的事实，对 `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的异常状态分析如下：\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **实体确认**：Namespace `aiops-case-v05`，Pod `workload`，UID `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`。\n*   **调度关系**：Pod 已调度至 `node2` (10.2.0.50)，容器名为 `app`，镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n*   **当前状态**：Pod 整体状态为 `Pending`，容器状态 `Waiting`，状态原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n\n### 事实支持（确认为根因）\n1.  **Mount Volume 失败事件明确**：`kubectl describe` 显示大量 `FailedMount` 警告（如 `x40` 次），明确指出核心错误为：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\"", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789126080474, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

